  "job_B8.1.4.5_20251003_114817": {
    "chunk_text": "angende & utgangende. Drihten afyl\u00f0 \u00f0ine fynd beforan \u00f0e; on anne weg hi ga\u00f0 ongean \u00f0e & on seofon wegum hi fleo\u00f0 fram Drihten sent bletsunga ofer \u00f0ine heddernu & ofer ealle \u00f0ine weorc \u00f0e \u00f0u wyrcst, & he bletsa\u00f0 \u00f0e on Drihten \u00f0e gecyst to halegum folce, swa swa he swor, gyf \u00f0u gehealtst Drihtnes bebodu, & ealle men Drihten gede\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u h\u00e6fst \u00e6lces godes genoh, swa swa he swor \u00f0inum f\u00e6derum. He geopena\u00f0 heofun, his selestan goldhord, & sent tidrenas on \u00f0in land; he bletsa\u00f0 ealle \u00f0ine weorc, Drihten \u00f0e geset symle on foreweard & na on \u00e6fteweard, & \u00f0u bist \u00e6fre bufan & na beny\u00f0an, gyf \u00f0u Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 eft to Israhela folce: Gyf \u00f0u nelt gehyran Drihtnes bebod, \u00f0ines Godes, \u00f0e ic \u00f0e to Beo \u00f0u awyriged binnan byrig & butan. Sy \u00f0in bearn awyrged & \u00f0ine lafa. Sy \u00feines inno\u00f0es w\u00e6stm awyrged & \u00f0ines landes w\u00e6stm & \u00feinra nytena. Beo \u00f0u awyrged ingangende & utgangende. Sende Drihten hungor & yrm\u00f0e ofer \u00f0e, o\u00f0 he \u00f0e fordo, for \u00f0am \u00f0e \u00f0u hine forlete. Sende Drihten cwealm on \u00f0e. Slea \u00f0e Drihten mid feforadle & mid cyle & mid h\u00e6tan & mid swole\u00f0an, o\u00f0 \u00f0u forwur\u00f0e. Sy \u00f0e heofune swylce",
